  "claim": "Britney Spears and Nicole Morier wrote \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene song, and one other song. That other song has a Latin pop influence, similar to song by Madonna that San Pedro Town was said to be the inspiration and was co-written and co-produced by her and Patrick Leonard.",
