        "original_id": "e6f24eec-04e6-5c87-8342-5e7f932729a8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears, Nicole Morier, Madonna, Patrick Leonard\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"Trouble for Me\"\n- Artists: Selena Gomez & the Scene\n- Concepts: Latin pop influence, songwriting, co-production\n- Places: San Pedro Town\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier wrote the songs \"Rock Me In\" and \"Trouble for Me.\"\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier also wrote \"Whiplash,\" which was recorded by Selena Gomez & the Scene.\n- \"Trouble for Me\" is the other song written by Britney Spears and Nicole Morier referenced in the chunk.\n- \"Trouble for Me\" has a Latin pop influence.\n- The chunk compares the Latin pop influence of \"Trouble for Me\" to a Madonna song inspired by San Pedro Town.\n- That Madonna song was co-written and co-produced by Madonna and Patrick Leonard.",
