        "original_id": "74e978b4-5427-559d-a7a3-b3674d728254",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Mmm Papi\", \"La Isla Bonita\", \"Whiplash\", \"Rock Me In\"\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch, Selena Gomez & the Scene\n- Albums: \"True Blue\"\n- Places: San Pedro Town\n\nFacts:\n- In 1984, San Pedro Town was granted town status.\n- In 1986, Madonna released \"La Isla Bonita\" on her third studio album, \"True Blue\".\n- \"La Isla Bonita\" was co-written and co-produced by Madonna and Patrick Leonard, and Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting.\n- San Pedro Town was sometimes said to have inspired \"La Isla Bonita\", which begins with the line \"last night I dreamt of San Pedro\".\n- \"Mmm Papi\" is noted for a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna's 1987 song \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- The same writers together wrote \"Mmm Papi\", \"Rock Me In\", and \"Whiplash\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
